  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_first_00",
      "hash64": "7E7F65259EA676C5",
      "text": "嘿！吃了吗？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_first_01",
      "hash64": "7E7F64259EA67512",
      "text": "惊涛海味料理人海岱！\\n前来为你上菜！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "333148F874699013",
      "text": "吁～！\\n原来是你呀！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "333147F874698E60",
      "text": "你身为学生却还负责\\n邀请特邀教员对吧！？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "33314AF874699379",
      "text": "真是个厉害得\\n不得了的孩子呀！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "6CA96FE2386E07BF",
      "text": "是呀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "6CA970E2386E0972",
      "text": "你过奖了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "333149F8746991C6",
      "text": "啊、哈、哈！你那份\\n敢于肯定自我的自信！\\r\\n真是爆护！爆护！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "6652552DCF6279AC",
      "text": "啊、哈、哈！称赞厉害的人\\n可是理所当然的事！\\r\\n你谦虚也不会有好处哦！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "33314CF8746996DF",
      "text": "真的很感谢\\n你给俺远征的机会！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "33314BF87469952C",
      "text": "俺也要和学生们\\n共同成长～！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "5DAF5EED2B0105C4",
      "text": "这里四面环海，\\n环境得天独厚！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "5DAF5FED2B010777",
      "text": "俺和宝可梦们都很兴奋\\n能感受到海风！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "5DAF60ED2B01092A",
      "text": "然而这里的食堂，\\n菜单里竟然没有海鲜……[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "5DAF61ED2B010ADD",
      "text": "如果能用附近海里的\\n新鲜食材做饭吃到饱……\\r\\n相信学生们会很高兴吧！？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "DCDC33941635FF0E",
      "text": "会高兴的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "DCDC32941635FD5B",
      "text": "现在这样也不错……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "5DAF5AED2B00FEF8",
      "text": "收到你的保证了！\\n男子汉海岱！要大显厨艺！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_04b",
      "hash64": "31F61B0012B09FAE",
      "text": "虽然偶尔吃些快餐也不错，\\n但每天吃可是会营养失衡的！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "5DAF5BED2B0100AB",
      "text": "学生们，等着吧！\\n稚鱼团团游动的渔场是食堂！\\r\\n海岱俱乐部开始营业！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "060394E58E8282B5",
      "text": "哦哦！俺告诉你件事，\\n保证让你惊掉下巴！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "060393E58E828102",
      "text": "蓝莓学园的学生食堂\\n要和海岱俱乐部……\\r\\n联手合作了！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "B93707623A53FE51",
      "text": "好厉害！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "B93704623A53F938",
      "text": "太让人期待了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "060392E58E827F4F",
      "text": "因为是刚刚才定下来的，\\n所以距离正式开始还需要一些时间～！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "060391E58E827D9C",
      "text": "首先俺要把\\n海岱俱乐部的名菜佛跳墙\\r\\n面向学生改良！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "060390E58E827BE9",
      "text": "因为俺想让正处于\\n发育时期的孩子们吃上好东西！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "06038FE58E827A36",
      "text": "……俺只是做了这辈子想做的事，\\n结果和食品教育的事挂上钩了！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "DE6D182A49C40B17",
      "text": "托你邀请俺来学园的福，\\n俺也学到东西了，收获爆护！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "DE6D172A49C40964",
      "text": "啊、哈、哈！\\n这可得感谢你啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "DE6D1A2A49C40E7D",
      "text": "你要顺着这个发展\\n和俺进行宝可梦交换吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "DE6D192A49C40CCA",
      "text": "啊、哈、哈！\\n俺会放出轻身鳕！\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你呢？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "DE6D142A49C4044B",
      "text": "是[VAR 0x0101(0001)]啊，真够生猛！\\n爆护！爆护！\\c\\n俺会亲手\\n培育它成长的～！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "DCC54E25225A79A8",
      "text": "你要用[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n和俺的轻身鳕交换吗？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "DCC54F25225A7B5B",
      "text": "无法使用初训家不是自己的\\n宝可梦进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
