    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "0AC0F49213BEA7E9",
      "text": "你交换给俺的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n可生猛活泼了！\\r\\n它是只有前途的宝可梦！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
